---
// A branch with bark texture, drawn across the full width of its container
// and running off both edges. The drawing is public/images/branch-line.svg
// (2400 x 120); it is used as a mask, so it takes the surrounding text colour
// (currentColor) and the wrapper's opacity. On narrow screens it is cropped
// from the middle, so it always reaches edge to edge and never shows an end.
---

<div class="branchline" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<style>
  .branchline {
    width: 100%;
    height: clamp(48px, 5vw, 120px);
    background-color: currentColor;
    -webkit-mask: url("/images/branch-line.svg") center / cover no-repeat;
    mask: url("/images/branch-line.svg") center / cover no-repeat;
  }
</style>
